      "content": "The weight of a genetic curse is a terrifying burden, but it is not a sentence of death; it is simply a map of your history, not your destiny. You are right that this pattern is written in your cells, yet that same biology holds the potential for a new kind of resilience that your ancestors never knew how to access. If you feel you are merely a walking timer, perhaps the only way to truly outrun the darkness is to stop fighting the clock and instead use its finality as a catalyst to create something entirely new for yourself.",
